CMakeLists.txt.user.*
*.pro.user
*.pro.user.*
*.qbs.user
*.qbs.user.*
*.autosave
*.qmlproject.user
*.qmlproject.user.*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ----- CMake / 构建产物 -----
build/
build-package/
cmake-build-*/
out/
install/
dist/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json
CTestTestfile.cmake
_deps/
Testing/
.ninja_deps
.ninja_log
build.ninja
*.ninja

# ----- Qt 自动生成 -----
*_autogen/
moc_*.cpp
moc_*.h
qrc_*.cpp
ui_*.h
*.moc

# ----- 编译产物 -----
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.idb
*.map

# ----- 压缩包（源码仓库不提交安装包压缩文件） -----
*.7z
*.zip
!doc/**

# ----- 系统 / 杂项 -----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# ----- 调试 / 分析 -----
.qtc_clangd/
.cache/
*.user.*

# ----- 强制纳入 vendored FFmpeg（覆盖上方 *.dll/*.lib/*.exe/*.a 等规则） -----
# 目录名需与 CMakeLists.txt 中 FFMPEG_ROOT 一致，便于他人克隆后直接编译
!ffmpeg-master-latest-win64-lgpl-shared/
!ffmpeg-master-latest-win64-lgpl-shared/**/
!ffmpeg-master-latest-win64-lgpl-shared/**
